{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/paradisepointsandiego/items/552110/", "pk": 552110, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/paradisepointsandiego/", "pk": 35607, "shortname": "paradisepointsandiego", "name": "Paradise Point Resort & Spa - San Diego", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Sound Bath & Meditation", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 11, "unicode": "Sound Bath & Meditation", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 0, "description": "## About\nThe sound bath can help quiet the mind to take you on a meditative journey connecting with the elements and awakening the chakra centers. The soothing sounds create vibration that will move through body, mind, and spirit to help relieve tension and stress and encourage optimal functioning. Participants may feel more relaxed and able to focus. Some may experience healing that is ready to be cleared. The body may feel lighter and more energetic. \n\nThe session begins with meditation to draw awareness into relaxing the body. Then you are guided to connect with an element that will help you to let go and to keep the mind still. Several different sound instruments will be played including 